  "adaptations": [
    "BoardUI registry aliases changed to local relative modules",
    "Ovio aliases changed to local relative modules; minimal selected",
    "Tree selected item gains controlled prop; no drag mutations",
    "Source originals retained alongside adapters; no fixture data used",
    "Vaul 1.1.2 React 19 compatibility only: RefObject<HTMLDivElement | null> in context/use-snap-points; browser-compatible ReturnType<typeof setTimeout> replaces NodeJS.Timeout. Upstream source remains byte-identical.",
    "CI19 visual correction: ReviewCenter queue retains real source objects; mobile queue cards stack full title/description/status beside a fixed arrow, horizontal object scrolling and one-column detail. No content hidden or fixture settlement introduced.",
    "Vaul style.css adapter syntax correction: pointer:fine rule targets the existing data-vaul-handle-hitarea span, whose touch target is expanded to 44px by the preceding base rule; remove stray colon from attribute selector to restore intended fine-pointer width/height 100%. This is not a pseudo-element. Upstream 1.1.2 raw remains unchanged.",
    "2026-11-10 motion integration: shared product tokens, interruptible selection and opt-in full-screen navigation swipe; original source copies and licenses remain intact. See DESIGN.md PW-M1–PW-M6 for source references and current verification boundaries."
  ],
  "usage": [
    {
      "id": "PW-15",
      "source": "upstream/vaul/src/index.tsx @ 3e97aac6a38e4481bade71d7233ed6002e80f9b0 / 1.1.2 MIT",
      "adapter": "adapted/vaul/src/index.tsx",
      "renderedAt": "App: allWork, task detail, phone/voice review, create project/file, chat attachment picker",
      "hostFields": [
        "tasks",
        "projects",
        "composer",
        "phoneDraft",
        "chatAttachmentPickerOpen"
      ],
      "hostActions": [
        "tasks.open",
        "tasks.close",
        "tasks.review",
        "phone.prepare",
        "phone.start",
        "voice.review",
        "voice.accept",
        "voice.discard",
        "attachments.openPicker",
        "attachments.closePicker"
      ],
      "controlledChanges": "Original source graph retained; neutral product surfaces, shouldScaleBackground=false. 2026-11-10: retained Vaul 1.1.2 and Radix focus/scroll/presence ownership; synchronized enter/exit timing with shared tokens and added an opt-in left navigation opening gesture using the existing Motion dependency. The same real drawer follows touch 1:1; release inherits measured velocity; controlled Back/cancel clears gesture authority immediately while presentation can finish. Other drawers keep their original drag path.",
      "status": {
        "sourceCopied": true,
        "adapted": true,
        "usedInFeature": true,
        "hostWiring": "implemented; not runtime verified",
        "compile": "pending GitHub CI",
        "visualInteraction": "not verified"
      }
    },
    {
